---
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
pagination:
  data: embed_registry
  size: 1
  alias: entry
permalink: "embed/f/{{ entry.id }}/"
---
{#- One bare card per entry in embed_registry.json (GH#4005): an opaque ID
    mapped to a card type and a data key, so we control what an ID shows
    without Gates changing anything on their page. The loader fetches this
    fragment and drops it straight into the custom element’s shadow root —
    no doctype, head, or body, just the card. -#}
{%- from "system/component.njk" import component -%}
{%- set org = embed_figures.org -%}
{%- set asOf = embed_figures.source.retrieved -%}
{%- if entry.type == "tile" -%}
{{ component("embed/tile", { id: entry.id, figure: embed_figures.figures[entry.key], org: org, asOf: asOf, headingLevel: 2 }) }}
{%- elif entry.type == "comparison" -%}
{{ component("embed/comparison", { id: entry.id, comparison: embed_figures.comparisons[entry.key], org: org, asOf: asOf, headingLevel: 2 }) }}
{%- elif entry.type == "headline" -%}
{{ component("embed/headline", { id: entry.id, headline: embed_figures.headlines[entry.key], org: org, asOf: asOf, headingLevel: 2 }) }}
{%- endif -%}
